    "author": "杨广",
    "dynasty": "隋",
    "url": "https://www.gushiwen.cn/shiwenv_8819c20e5f18.aspx"
  },
  {
    "line": "寒鸦飞数点，流水绕孤村",
    "title": "野望",
    "author": "杨广",
    "dynasty": "隋",
    "url": "https://www.gushiwen.cn/shiwenv_53075671c008.aspx"
  },
  {
    "line": "曾经沧海难为水，除却巫山不是云",
