    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "dynasty": "宋",
    "url": "https://www.gushiwen.cn/shiwenv_098e88b62d38.aspx"
  },
  {
    "line": "人生长恨水长东",
    "title": "临江仙·自洛阳往孟津道中作",
    "author": "元好问",
    "dynasty": "金",
    "url": "https://www.gushiwen.cn/shiwenv_32e21765bdbd.aspx"
  },
  {
    "line": "青山相待，白云相爱，梦不到紫罗袍共黄金带",
